CHAPTER.VERS:
And if the LORD thy God 

          When you go over Jordan to possess the whole land of Canaan.
         enlarge thy coast, as he hath sworn unto thy fathers, and give thee all the land which he promised to give unto thy fathers;

Then both the men, between whom the controversy [is], shall stand before the 

          God's presence where his true ministers are assembled.
         LORD, before the priests and the judges, which shall be in those days;
